title: $:/plugins/nikorion/dyntable/language/en-GB/history
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.15 -- Hello! Dynamic Table extracted from [[Shiraz|https://github.com/kookma/TW-Shiraz]] as an independent plugin, fully localised (en-GB, fr-FR: column headers, tooltips, pagination, footer, date format).
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.17 -- Internal tags renamed `$:/tags/Table/*` → `$:/tags/nk-Table/*`: safe to install alongside Shiraz now (was previously incompatible).
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.17 -- Added `table-variants.css` (built-in, no dependency): `table-hover`, `table-striped-row/col`, `table-borderless`, `thead-*` and more, ported from Shiraz's `styles/tables.css`.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- New `footer` attribute: computed footer rows (`sum average:1 max@priority`), translated labels, no hand-typed cells. Footer labels typed by hand (`Sum`…) are translated too; header cells and due dates follow the wiki language. The "Numerical summary" row is gone.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- Any cell holding a TiddlyWiki or ISO date is shown in the localised date format, whatever its column name.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- Removed the `due` column alias (use `due-date`).
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- Past dates in the `due-date` column are greyed out (`tbldyn-overdue` class, overridable in your own CSS).
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- New `table-rounded` / `table-rounded-0…5` classes to round the top corners of the table header.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- `table-rounded*` also rounds the bottom corners; new `tfoot-*` classes colour the footer rows.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- Fixed footer and pagination rows being wider than the header and body in view mode when the table has `tbl-clone`/`tbl-delete` columns (they only exist in edit mode).
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- The pagination row is now the last row of the `<tfoot>`, below the calculation rows, and takes the `tfoot-*` colour. The footer label spans the leading action columns.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- New `table-sides` class: vertical rules on the far left and right of the body rows only.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- `table-lines` now also separates the footer rows (calculations and pagination).
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.19 -- The pagination row now inherits the `tfoot-*` colours (page-size select and buttons).
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.21 -- New footer calculations `unique` (number of distinct values) and `range` (max − min); footer labels shortened (Avg., Med., Prod., Min., Max.) and shown in bold serif with a trailing colon.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.21 -- Rows with `status` `done` now use pale green text (theme-aware) instead of a background; `dropped` greys the text; `paused` is no longer styled. Priority labels take their emoji's colour, muted on done rows; done rows' due dates are muted. Column headings use a web-safe serif font.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.21 -- Footer calculation labels have a tooltip: full name, then a short description of the operation on a new line.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.21 -- Numeric cells and computed `footer` values are rendered with TW-Math (`<$math>`, following its settings) when that plugin is installed and enabled; plain text otherwise.
* ''1.0.0'' -- 2026.09.24 -- Plugin renamed `TW-Table` → `TW-Dynamic-Table` (short name `table` → `dyntable`, id `$:/plugins/nikorion/table` → `$:/plugins/nikorion/dyntable`), macro renamed `<<table>>` → `<<dyntable>>` — frees the `TW-Table` name for the new static CSV-table plugin ported from Shiraz's `ct-*`. Reinstall required for wikis using the old title; no automatic migration.
